# Original, unprocessed source photos - only the cropped/compressed .jpg
# assets actually used by the app (hero-square.jpg and its @2x/@3x) are
# tracked. Keeping a multi-MB source PNG in git history for a ~25-140KB
# shipped asset isn't worth it; the source stays on disk (whatever its name)
# for future re-cropping.
assets/images/heroimage/*.png
